DATA-SOURCE ATTRIBUTION

The paper metadata, citations, abstracts, and full-text used in the pipeline
that produced this software's shipped snapshot come from third-party sources
with their own terms. This code repository is MIT-licensed; the data those
sources provide is NOT re-licensed here.

- OpenAlex (https://openalex.org/) — paper metadata, citations, abstracts (CC0)
- Semantic Scholar (https://www.semanticscholar.org/) — metadata enrichment;
    see Semantic Scholar API terms for redistribution
- Unpaywall (https://unpaywall.org/) — open-access PDFs for extraction
- Europe PMC (https://europepmc.org/) — open-access full-text (JATS)
- arXiv (https://arxiv.org/) — preprint full-text

Only short structured extractions (claims, limitations, future-work
statements — each under ~260 characters) are redistributed. Original paper
full-text is used to produce those extractions and is NOT republished.
